      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Vaiya Thalaimai Kol&quot; by V. Iraianbu explores the essence of true leadership, emphasizing the importance of working with dedication and a sense of service. The book encourages readers, especially the youth, to engage in their endeavors with passion and precision. It highlights that while working for others is a form of service, genuine effort driven by inner conviction is what truly constitutes hard work. This insightful guide outlines practical methods for preparing oneself to take on leadership roles, offering a realistic perspective on the attributes and mindset required to lead effectively.</marc:subfield>
